Copyright (c) 2026 Welfarego.

Welfarego OFFICE is an independent derivative distribution built on top of the
official open-source LibreOffice 26.2.7 engine (MPL-2.0, together with its
included LGPLv3/Apache-2.0/MIT third-party components) combined with original
Welfarego branding, Korean Ribbon UI presets, and extensions under MPL-2.0.

Complete corresponding source code is publicly available at:
  - Welfarego modifications & scripts: https://github.com/BUSTUDY/welfarego
  - Direct source archive: https://welfarego.co.kr/office/download/mpl2-source.zip
  - Upstream LibreOffice 26.2.7 source: https://download.documentfoundation.org/libreoffice/src/26.2.7/

